<title>THAILAND: Thailand's CP Feedmill makes US investment.</title>
<headline>Thailand's CP Feedmill makes US investment.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Charoen Pokphand Feedmill Plc said on Tuesday in a statement that it has invested $17.15 million to take a 49 percent stake in a new U.S.-based feedmill company.</p>
<p>The company, which will be called Charoen Pokphand (US) Inc, will run a broiler integration business in Alabama.</p>
</text>
